  "content": {
    "id": "p5-q1-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Determine whether:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x=2$ is a solution of $x+3=5$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=2+3\\\\\\text{LHS}&=5\\\\\\text{RHS}&=5\\end{align*}$$Since LHS = RHS, $x=2$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$x=-2$ is a solution of $4-x=7$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=4-(-2)\\\\\\text{LHS}&=6\\\\\\text{RHS}&=7\\end{align*}$$Since LHS $\\ne$ RHS, $x=-2$ is not a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$x=4$ is a solution of $3(x-2)=6$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=3(4-2)\\\\\\text{LHS}&=6\\\\\\text{RHS}&=6\\end{align*}$$Since LHS = RHS, $x=4$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$x=\\frac{3}{4}$ is a solution of $4x+3=5$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=4\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)+3\\\\\\text{LHS}&=6\\\\\\text{RHS}&=5\\end{align*}$$Since LHS $\\ne$ RHS, $x=\\frac{3}{4}$ is not a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$x=3$ is a solution of $x+3=9-x$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=3+3\\\\\\text{LHS}&=6\\\\\\text{RHS}&=9-3\\\\\\text{RHS}&=6\\end{align*}$$Since LHS = RHS, $x=3$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$x=-2$ is a solution of $2x+8=-3x-7$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=2(-2)+8\\\\\\text{LHS}&=4\\\\\\text{RHS}&=-3(-2)-7\\\\\\text{RHS}&=-1\\end{align*}$$Since LHS $\\ne$ RHS, $x=-2$ is not a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$x=3$ is a solution of $\\frac{x}{6}=\\frac{x+1}{9}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{3}{6}\\\\\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\text{RHS}&=\\frac{3+1}{9}\\\\\\text{RHS}&=\\frac{4}{9}\\end{align*}$$Since LHS $\\ne$ RHS, $x=3$ is not a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$x=2$ is a solution of $\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{x}{6}=2$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{2}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{2}{6}\\\\\\text{LHS}&=1+\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{3}\\\\\\text{LHS}&=2\\\\\\text{RHS}&=2\\end{align*}$$Since LHS = RHS, $x=2$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q1-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$x=0.15$ is a solution of $4x+0.2=2x+0.5$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=4(0.15)+0.2\\\\\\text{LHS}&=0.8\\\\\\text{RHS}&=2(0.15)+0.5\\\\\\text{RHS}&=0.8\\end{align*}$$Since LHS = RHS, $x=0.15$ is a solution.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 6
      }
    ]
  },
